---
/** The legacy logged-out state of /organizer ("Login Required"). Used by every portal page when the visitor is not logged in. */
---
<div class="container section">
  <div style="max-width:700px; margin:0 auto; padding:2rem 1rem;">
    <h1 class="heading-lg" style="margin-bottom:1rem; text-align:center;">Partner with Jagruk Jaipur 🚀</h1>
    <p class="text-muted" style="margin-bottom:2.5rem; font-size:1.1rem; line-height:1.6; text-align:center;">
      Register as an organizer to easily submit your events, publish customized ticket tiers, track sales dashboard, and manage your weekly settlements.
    </p>
    <div class="glass-box slide-up" style="padding:4rem 2rem; text-align:center; max-width:500px; margin:4rem auto; background:rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1); border-radius:18px;">
      <div style="font-size:4rem; margin-bottom:1rem;">🔑</div>
      <h2 style="margin-bottom:.5rem;">Login Required</h2>
      <p class="text-muted" style="margin-bottom:2rem; line-height:1.6;">Please verify your WhatsApp number to start your registration as an organizer.</p>
      <a href="#" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg needs-auth-ticket-btn" data-ticket-url="/organizer" data-source-page="/organizer" data-source-button="Organizer Signup Login" style="width:100%; justify-content:center; font-size:1.1rem; padding:0.95rem;">
        Log in via WhatsApp
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
